  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Meaningful Justice for Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SJAC contributes to meaningful justice and accountability for Syria by leading the development of efforts to document abuses perpetrated during the course of the conflict, developing new technologies and methodologies to securely preserve and analyze human rights documentation for use in transitional justice and peace-building,  providing analysis, both privately and via public reports, of human rights violations happening within Syria, and engaging with Syrians to ensure they have the knowledge they need in order to directly and meaningfully participate in justice processes.</narrative>
  </description>
